sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Caller A
    participant B as Caller B
    participant C as Cache
    participant F as Shared factory

    A->>C: getOrLoad(key)
    C->>F: Start factory
    B->>C: getOrLoad(key)
    C-->>B: Join flight
    A--xC: Abort A's signal
    C-->>A: Reject A's wait
    Note over C,F: Factory continues for B
    F-->>C: Resolve value
    C-->>B: Return value
    Note over C: Cache only if flight is current
